<title>COSTA RICA: SOCCER-COSTA RICA BEAT UNITED STATES 3-2.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-COSTA RICA BEAT UNITED STATES 3-2.</headline>
<dateline>SAN JOSE 1997-03-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Costa Rica beat the United</p>
<p>States 3-2 (halftime 2-1) in a CONCACAF final stage World Cup</p>
<p>qualifying match on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Costa Rica - Hernan Medford (10), Mauricio Solis (32),</p>
<p>Ronald Gomez (76)</p>
<p>United States - Eric Wynalda (24), Roy Lassiter (68)</p>
<p>Attendance: 23,000</p>
<p>Standings (tabulate under played, won, drawn, lost, goals</p>
<p>for, goals against, points)</p>
<p> Mexico	     2  1  1  0  4  0  4</p>
<p> United States    3  1  1  1  5  3  4</p>
<p> Costa Rica	 2  1  1  0  3  2  4</p>
<p> Jamaica	    1  0  1  0  0  0  1</p>
<p> Canada	     2  0  0  2  0  7  0</p>
<p> El Salvador	-  -  -  -  -  -  -</p>
</text>
